THIRD-PARTY CONTENT

mod/selector_script.h embeds the CLEO-Android script "selector de ropa.csi"
(4882 bytes, SHA-256 9f59703dfc21eda6391eacc11a1a34f398ddce2cd567e392e4ea8719b881a765),
which is the work of Alexander Blade. It is redistributed here unmodified, as
the payload this mod exists to launch. It is not covered by the MIT license
above; see the Credits section of README.md.

mod/ is vendored from gta-sa-menu-kit, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Jean7z.

psdk/ is a git submodule pointing at aml-psdk, GNU GPL v3.